{
  "about": "The components distributed with the app, for its licenses screen (task 8-2; settings, About). The build (cmake/AboutData.cmake) copies each license text into the app's ui/about/ folder with one about.json the page reads; a text that is not there stops the configure step. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md is the human-readable list: the two change together (ui/src/about.test.ts checks them against each other and against the FetchContent_Declare calls). Fields: id (lowercase, file names), name (as the heading in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, before its parenthesis), version, license (SPDX), url, copyright (lines), parent (the id of the component it is bundled in), fetch (its FetchContent name), note (a key of the page's tables, ui/src/i18n/parts/about.ts), texts (each license text: path, inside the FetchContent source named by fetch, or else inside this repository). Build- and test-only components are not listed.",
